flowchart TD
    A([Open the app]) --> B{Signed-in session exists and not idle-expired?}
    B -->|Yes| LAND[Go to requested page or role landing page]
    B -->|No| C{Which entry?}
    C -->|/login| L1[Office sign-in: email or username + password]
    C -->|/driver/login| L2[Driver sign-in: mobile, email or username]
    C -->|/customer/login| L3[Customer sign-in: mobile, email or username]
    L1 --> V
    L2 --> V
    L3 --> V
    V{Fields valid?} -->|No| E1[Enter your email address or username / Enter your password] --> C
    V -->|Yes| U{Account found?}
    U -->|No| E2[The email/username or password is incorrect] --> C
    U -->|Yes| LK{Account locked?}
    LK -->|Yes| E3[Temporarily locked - try again in N minutes or ask an administrator] --> C
    LK -->|No| PW{Password correct?}
    PW -->|No| CNT[Count failed attempt] --> MAX{Attempts >= max - default 5?}
    MAX -->|Yes| LOCKED[Lock for lockout minutes - default 15, audit ACCOUNT_LOCKED] --> C
    MAX -->|No| E2
    PW -->|Yes| ACT{Account active?}
    ACT -->|No| E4[This account is inactive. Contact your administrator] --> C
    ACT -->|Yes| SES[Create session: Keep me signed in = localStorage, else sessionStorage]
    SES --> MCP{Must change password?}
    MCP -->|Yes| CP["/account/change-password?required=1"]
    MCP -->|No| ROLE{Role landing page}
    ROLE -->|DRIVER| DD["/driver/dashboard"]
    ROLE -->|CUSTOMER| CD["/customer/dashboard"]
    ROLE -->|Office roles| OD["/dashboard - role dashboard"]
    DD --> WORK[Work]
    CD --> WORK
    OD --> WORK
    CP --> ROLE
    WORK --> IDLE{Idle longer than session timeout - default 60 min?}
    IDLE -->|Yes| OUT[Signed out automatically - SessionWatcher]
    WORK -->|Sign out| OUT2["/logout confirm"]
    OUT --> BACK{Which app was used?}
    OUT2 --> BACK
    BACK -->|/driver/...| L2
    BACK -->|/customer/...| L3
    BACK -->|Office| L1
